Loom: accept workgroup barriers under a subgroup-uniform region branch when every region runs the same barrier
sequence (loops: workgroup-uniform bounds and matching bodies). Each subgroup then arrives at every barrier instance
once whichever region it takes, the per-subgroup arrival count AMDGPU s_barrier implements. Lets one wave run its own
loop beside the others (gen_gdn_ss9: a solver wave). A mismatched sequence still fails STRUCTURE/038.
